WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.700
TINAIMBAG ADAMAG KAS INSURAT NI SAN MATTHEW

00:03.700 --> 00:07.300
SAN MATTHEW CAPITULO UNO

00:07.300 --> 00:17.360
Daito'y tilibro tikapuunan ni Jesucristo anagtaod itikapututan ni David, anagtaod met itikapututan ni Abraham.

00:17.960 --> 00:24.560
Manipod kini Abraham aginga kini Ari David, at to'y dagitinailista akapututan.

00:24.560 --> 00:42.860
Abraham, Isaac, Jacob, Huda kindagitikakabsatna, Sumarunuda, Faris, Kenzara, naanak ni Tamar, Ezrum, Aram, Aminadab, Naason, Salmon, Buas, naanak ni Rahab,

00:42.860 --> 00:46.680
