00:47.080 --> 00:54.360
Dagiti kapututan manipod kini David, aginga idinapagtalaw dagiti Israelita, akas balod kitna ipanibig.

00:54.560 --> 01:19.580
David, Solomon, putot ni David iti asawa idin Urias, Rubuam, Abias, Asa, Josaphat, Horam, Osias, Huatam, Akas, Hezikayas, Manases, Amon, Hosias, kini Hekonyas, agramandagitikakabsatna.

